%% CTU-Service - Ingestion Pipeline (Detailed Sequence Diagram)
%% Actors: Admin -> API -> OCR Service -> Markdown Processor -> Metadata Validator
%%         -> Chunking Service -> Embedding Service -> PostgreSQL -> Qdrant
%% Tham chieu: .docs/spec/ctu-service/07_RAG_SPEC.md, 08_OCR_INGESTION_SPEC.md

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Admin
    participant API as API<br/>(FastAPI)
    participant OCR as OCR Service<br/>(LlamaParse)
    participant MD as Markdown<br/>Processor
    participant MV as Metadata<br/>Validator
    participant CH as Chunking<br/>Service
    participant EMB as Embedding<br/>Service (bge-m3)
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant QD as Qdrant

    Admin->>API: Upload document (PDF/DOCX)
    Note right of Admin: Input: raw file

    API->>PG: Create document + ingestion_job
    PG-->>API: job_id
    API-->>Admin: 202 Accepted (job_id)

    API->>OCR: Run OCR on raw file
    Note right of OCR: Input: raw file bytes
    OCR-->>API: OCR text (raw)
    Note left of OCR: Output: OCR text

    API->>MD: Convert OCR text to canonical Markdown
    MD-->>API: Canonical Markdown
    API->>PG: Update ocr_status = done
    Note left of MD: Output: Markdown + front-matter

    Admin->>API: Complete metadata (YAML front-matter)
    API->>MV: Validate metadata YAML
    Note right of MV: Input: document_key, title,<br/>domain, audience...

    alt Metadata invalid
        MV-->>API: Validation errors
        API-->>Admin: 422 Fix required fields
        Admin->>API: Resubmit corrected metadata
        API->>MV: Re-validate
    end

    MV-->>API: Metadata valid
    API->>PG: Save metadata, review_status = approved
    Note left of MV: Output: validated metadata

    Admin->>API: Publish to RAG
    API->>CH: Chunk canonical Markdown
    Note right of CH: Input: Markdown + metadata
    CH-->>API: Parent chunks + child chunks
    Note left of CH: Output: chunk list<br/>(parent_chunk_id, chunk_type)
    API->>PG: Store parent/child chunks

    API->>EMB: Embed child chunks
    Note right of EMB: Input: child chunk text
    EMB-->>API: Embedding vectors (1024-dim)
    Note left of EMB: Output: normalized vectors

    API->>QD: Upsert vectors + payload
    Note right of QD: Input: chunk_key, vector,<br/>document_key, version_key
    QD-->>API: Upsert acknowledged

    API->>PG: Set rag_status = published
    API-->>Admin: Publish success
    Note left of API: Output: document active in RAG

